Third-party data

Sources/Polyglot/PolyglotRandom.swift contains the 781 Random64 numbers of the
Polyglot opening book format. They are reproduced from the format description
at http://hgm.nubati.net/book_format.html, which takes them from the source code
of PolyGlot by Fabien Letouzey (GPL). The format description states that the
table is not believed to be covered by copyright and that the algorithm may be
freely implemented, including in closed-source programs. The values are
included here only as the data needed to read and write Polyglot books; no
PolyGlot code is included. The MIT license above covers this package's own
code; it does not claim any rights over that table.
